  TRIAL TYPE         BUILD  UNRECOV  BT-1 INC RESCUED  RATE    CENSORED mean dur
  controlled_hang    stock  1/4      3/4      1/3      75%     0/4      100s
      treatment: autosusp=N

  These rows must never be added together. An observational boot
  and a controlled protocol run are different evidence: the first
  says the machine did or did not hang during ordinary use, the
  second says the reproduction protocol was applied and the
  controller withstood it or did not. Only controlled_* rows can
  satisfy the A/B/C/D gate.
